    "body": "## Summary\n\n**ADR-044 — `border-radius`.** Three commits on one branch, merged only after Commit 2's PNG verification.\n\n**First cycle in this arc with multi-element visible delta**: search field completes (border from ADR-040 + radius here), 135 buttons, 715 inline code pills, message boxes.\n\n## Commits\n\n| # | Scope | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Parse + layout fields** (behavior-neutral) | ✅ Green — 562 / 2188 tests pass, +11 new |\n| 2 | **Paint** (visible: rounded corners everywhere) | ⏳ Pending — PNG verification before merge |\n| 3 | **Docs** (ADR-044 → Implemented) | ⏳ Pending |\n\n## Measurement (Wikipedia CSS, 2026-10-28)\n\n### Value forms — trivially scoped\n\n| Form | Count |\n|---|---|\n| Single value (`2px`) | **10** |\n| `inherit` | 1 |\n| Percentage (`50%`) | 2 |\n| Multi-value (2/3/4 tokens) | **0** |\n| Elliptical (`5px / 10px`) | **0** |\n\n**Zero multi-value and zero elliptical** — v1 grammar is trivial.\n\n### First-viewport targets\n\n| Element | HTML count | Predicted delta |\n|---|---|---|\n| `code` (inline) | **715** | Rounded code pills |\n| `.cdx-button` | **135** | Rounded buttons |\n| `.cdx-search-input` | 8 | **Search field completes** |\n| `.cdx-message` | — | Rounded issue box |\n\n**4+ first-viewport changes.** Largest delta of the 040-044 arc.\n\n## Commit 1 details\n\n- `LayoutBox::border_radius[4]` (TL, TR, BR, BL; default 0)\n- `border-radius: <length>` shorthand → all four corners\n- Per-corner longhands (`border-top-left-radius` etc.) override shorthand\n- `inherit` / `unset` / `initial` → 0 (deferred; one Wikipedia case has `overflow: hidden` parent → equivalent visual)\n- Percentage → 0 (deferred; radio buttons `display: none`)\n- Multi-value / elliptical → first token only (documented; 0 uses)\n- Malformed → 0\n\n## Commit 2 preview (visible delta)\n\n- `rounded_rect_path()` helper using `cairo_arc` + `cairo_close_path`\n- `paint_box` uses it when any `border_radius[i] > 0`\n- **Two-fill approach**: outer path with `border_color`, inner path (inset by border) with `background_color` → rounded border follows curve without `cairo_stroke`\n- PNG verification required before merge\n\n## Deferred (per ADR-044)\n\n- Percentage radius (radio buttons hidden)\n- `inherit` (parent clip = equivalent)\n- Multi-value shorthand (0 uses; first token only)\n- Elliptical (0 uses)\n- `border-radius` transitions\n- **Rounded box-shadow** (shadow follows curve — own ADR)\n\n## Test count\n\n- Before ADR-044: 551 cases / 2125 assertions\n- After Commit 1: **562 cases / 2188 assertions** (+11 / +63)\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n\n- [ ] **Two-fill for border** — outer `border_color`, inner `background_color` → rounded border without stroke-offset complexity. Alternative (offset + stroke) rejected for v1. Agree?\n- [ ] **Simple radius clamp** (`min(r, w/2, h/2)` per corner) — Wikipedia's 2px on 100px+ boxes never triggers. Full CSS §5.5 proportional clamp deferred. Agree?\n- [ ] **`inherit` / percentage deferred** — one use each, both with equivalent-via-other-means visual (parent clip / element hidden). Documented. Agree?\n- [ ] **Multi-value / elliptical: first token only** — 0 uses, safer than dropping the rule if future site needs them. Agree?\n- [ ] **PNG verification gates merge** — Commit 2 must show search field, buttons, code pills rounded; no artifacts.\n\n## DO NOT MERGE until Commit 2's PNG verification passes.\n\nRefs #215",
